  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 96 ÷ 6 - 16 + 12 × 8 = 40.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 6 and 16\n\nGiven: 96 ÷ 6 - 16 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**96 ÷ 16**__ - 6 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\n⇒ 6 - 6 + __**12 × 8**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**6**__ - 6 __**+ 96**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __102 - 6__ = 40\n\n⇒ 96 ≠ 40\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 96 and 16\n\nGiven: 96 ÷ 6 - 16 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 6**__ - 96 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\n⇒ 2.66 - 96 + __**12 × 8**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**2.66 - 96 + **__**__96__** = 40\n\n⇒ 2.66 ≠ 40\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 6 and 8\n\nGiven: 96 ÷ 6 - 16 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**96 ÷ 8**__ - 16 + 12 × 6 = 40\n\n⇒ 12 - 16 + __**12 × 6**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**12**__ - 16 __**+ 72**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __84** - 16**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 68 ≠ 40\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 6 and 12**\n\nGiven: 96 ÷ 6 - 16 + 12 × 8 = 40\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**96 ÷ 12**__ - 16 + 6 × 8 = 40\n\n⇒ 8 - 16 + __**6**____** × 8**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 16 __**+ 48**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __56____ - 16__ = 40\n\n⇒ 40 = 40\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
